277
00:50:32.410 --> 00:50:50.230
Jonathan Tostevin (Observer): And reuse is an idea that's obviously been around for a long time. People used to reuse, food and drink packaging all the time, you know, kind of the milkman model, or, even in Singapore from the 60s, you know, people getting… I forget the name, that escaped me, but, like, from your copy in, like, a… in, like, an aluminium tin.

