00:50:58.810 --> 00:51:18.629
Jonathan Tostevin (Observer): And so, we thought, well, if there's a way to make reuse… bring reuse back, but make it more convenient, and whether we could use tech to enable that. So that's kind of really how we started, and this, how do we make it simple and convenient has kind of really been at the heart of everything we've tried to do since then.

