420
01:13:13.360 --> 01:13:32.639
Jamie (SG Eco Loop): why is your solution going to be able to address the problem? So you need to link it back. So this problem and solution is always leaked. I've also seen, situations where you build a problem, and then it actually solves a totally different problem. I mean, you build a solution which solves a totally different problem than what you had set out to do.

421
01:13:32.640 --> 01:13:37.130
Jamie (SG Eco Loop): It's actually okay if it's a new, good problem to solve.

422
01:13:37.330 --> 01:13:43.209
