02:23:59.200 --> 02:24:17.160
Jamie (SG Eco Loop): rather than forcing people to be fully vegan, like, everybody must be fully vegan, then, like, very few people can really commit to not eating meat at all. Rather than that, you know, we created things like a meatless Monday, so everybody don't eat meat on Monday, or we avoid eating meat, at least one day a week.

662
02:24:17.430 --> 02:24:20.359
Jamie (SG Eco Loop): Right? So that helps. So all of those things

