02:24:20.360 --> 02:24:37.849
Jamie (SG Eco Loop): So everybody, if you know everybody in the world cuts our eating of meat by 1%, that's 1 whole percent. But if only, like, 10 people in the world are fully vegan, then that's very, very little impact. So that's what it means. So if your solution is easier to deploy at skill.

